@startuml
!theme plain

left to right direction

rectangle "Codex" as Codex
rectangle "AGENTS.md" as Agents
rectangle "docker-build.sh" as Script
rectangle "BuildKit builder" as Builder
rectangle "Linux cgroup" as Cgroup

Codex --> Agents : read policy
Agents --> Script : invoke fixed script
Script --> Builder : create or reuse
Builder --> Cgroup : cpu-shares=256
Cgroup --> Builder : dynamic CPU time

@enduml

